[00:00.320]Lesson 103. | 第103课
[00:04.420]How is the examination /ɪɡˌzæmɪˈneɪʃn/, Dick? | 考试怎么样，迪克？
[00:07.120]Not too bad. | 还不算太糟。
[00:09.120]I think I passed /pɑːst/ in English and Mathematics /ˌmæθəˈmætɪks/. | 我想我英语和数学都及格了。
[00:13.010]The questions /ˈkwestʃənz/ were very easy /ˈiːzi/. | 题目很容易。
[00:16.140]How about you, Harry? | 你呢，哈里？
[00:17.910]The English and Maths /mæθs/ papers /ˈpeɪpəz/ weren't easy /ˈiːzi/ enough /ɪˈnʌf/ for me. | 英语和数学对我来说不够简单。
[00:22.580]I hope I haven't failed /feɪld/. | 我希望我没有不及格。
[00:25.330]I think I failed /feɪld/ the intelligence test /ɪnˈtelɪdʒəns test/. | 我想我智力测验不及格了。
[00:29.070]I could answer 16 of the questions /ˈkwestʃənz/. | 我能回答16道题。
[00:32.260]They were very easy /ˈiːzi/. | 它们很容易。
[00:34.500]But I couldn't answer the rest /rest/. | 但我不能回答其他的。
[00:37.040]They were too difficult /ˈdɪfɪkəlt/ for me. | 它们对我来说太难了。
[00:39.630]Intelligence tests /ɪnˈtelɪdʒəns tests/ are awful, aren't they? | 智力测验太糟糕了，不是吗？
[00:43.080]I hate /heɪt/ them. | 我讨厌它们。
[00:44.750]I'm sure I've got a low /ləʊ/ IQ. | 我肯定我的智商很低。
[00:47.370]Oh, cheer up /ˌtʃɪər ˈʌp/. | 哦，振作起来。
[00:49.190]Perhaps we didn't do too badly. | 也许我们做得没那么糟。
[00:52.320]The fellow /ˈfeləʊ/ next to me wrote his name at the top /tɒp/ of the paper /ˈpeɪpə/. | 我旁边的那个人把他的名字写在了试卷的顶部。
[00:56.280]Yes? | 是吗？
[00:57.480]Then he sat there and looked at it for three hours. | 然后他坐在那里看了三个小时。
[01:02.160]He didn't write a word. | 他一个字也没写。